<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's fish exports up 18 percent in 1996.</title>
<headline>Morocco's fish exports up 18 percent in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's fish exports rose 18.2 percent to 8.15 billion dirhams ($868 million) in 1996, an official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The government-run National Fishing Office plans to invest 200 million dirhams over the next five years to modernise the sector, its director-general Toufik Ibrahimi said.</p>
<p>The 8.15 billion dirham fish exports accounted for 19 percent of Morocco's total exports in 1996, he added.</p>
<p>($1 = 9.38 dirhams)</p>
</text>
